  ["B", "Needs outside people or data: labelled corpora, gold standards, reference implementations (R, MAPIE, scikit-survival), a red team, replication, a domain owner, a prospective head-to-head, real panels, external benchmarks, a reviewer other than the author, or something that exists only after a push (a CI observation, a published release).", "43"],
